{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle incremental adventure in space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine Asteroids</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine even more asteroids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy even more upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off enemy AI drones who are attempting to interrupt your mining operations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build friendly AI drones, Helper Drones, Mining Lasers, and Human Crew members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your mining vessel stronger through Masteries, Affinities, Temperaments, Compute, Recycling, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft equipment, then enhance it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to Earth (prestige) and earn 5 different resources, which can be used to build help or upgrade your stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a faction, earn faction rewards, craft faction emblems, and find a place on the alignment grid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different sectors, each one with its own set of rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1,400 rewards to earn, each of which comes with a small stat boost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new features and new challenges all the way up to zone 1000</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline progress through the Time Bank. Offline minutes are added to the bank and can be used to simulate game time at your convenience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848230?t=1754081529","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848230?t=1754081529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848230/9f71cda807a0028d02d0df26248638992dbfbf6d/capsule_231x87.jp